            <ArticleTitle>[Sonography in intensive care medicine?].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>135-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It is out of question: Sonography should be the first diagnostic step in viewing the intestines, child's brain and in some parts, the organs of basal thorax. It is the method of first choice regarding the possibility of instantaneous application and permanent reproduction.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
